Rule 1 (inputs must be float32/float64 and have matching dtypes)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= (dtype_(v_1) = 7 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 8) ∧ dtype_(v_2) = dtype_(v_1)
